  <item>
    <title>《金钱心理学》为什么我打工这么久又不快乐又没存啥钱！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671dd6d6eb46cd6655051f7a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671dd6d6eb46cd6655051f7a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2024 05:59:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 背景：个人说明书（状态不好的时候会不停回看这本书）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 推荐播客《纵横四海》和《文化有限》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">05:44</a>没有人真的对钱失去理智</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a> 运气与风险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 永不知足</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a>复利之谜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">23:34</a> 致富vs守富</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">28:33</a>尾部的胜利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">29:43</a> 自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 豪车悖论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2093">34:53</a>财富是你看不见的那些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 存钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2604">43:24</a>合乎情理胜过绝对理性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 意外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2998">49:58</a>容错空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3317">55:17</a> 人是会变的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3488">58:08</a> 每个人的情况不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">1:01</a>当你相信一切的时候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">1:03</a>总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">1:04</a> 祝你晚安</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lggXkqaSXH5le-kRQBL4wJz_XuSU.m4a" length="45926350" type="audio/mp4"/>
